5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Rin. But we need to know the costs first.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We still have to live here. Let's not make it worse.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know the time commitment. Who is doing the work?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One house has suffered for years. We need fairness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,What if we just move it? Or build a box?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,Building sounds expensive. I worry about the budget.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Moving it might just move the problem.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"If I have to supervise, I need to know how long.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we build, who pays? It can't be just one.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see what the neighbors did.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the ledger and the subsidy.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll look at the complaint log and the frontages.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I need the truck time and the supervised morning data.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the filing requirements and the station minutes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Okay. Let's see what we find.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,Yes. Let's be fair to everyone's wallets.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,And to our nerves.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,And to our mornings.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,And to our gates.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
