35,2,1,talk,Rin,,I checked the station block. Their bin house smells worse in summer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Eleven complaints came from one house. The frontages are uneven.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The truck comes at seven forty. Supervision is fifty minutes a turn.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Building takes four months and five signatures. The station block fought over sweeping.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,So a box is a trap? The smell gets trapped inside.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,And the subsidy only covers forty percent. That is a lot of money.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we move it, the narrow house gets stuck.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Fifty minutes is fine, but waking up early is not.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we build, we just create new arguments about cleaning.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want a box. I don't want to smell it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,I can't afford a big share of a new build.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Rotating seems fairer, but the narrow frontage is a problem.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I can do the turns, but the early start is tough.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Rotating avoids the permanent burden on one gate.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,Let's try rotating. But we need a clear schedule.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"If we rotate, the costs are shared. That helps my budget.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,It keeps us talking. We have to manage the narrow spot.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I can handle the early mornings if we rotate fairly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,It is the only option that doesn't trap the burden.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
