61,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option C is too expensive. Option A is too much work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B is messy, but it shares the pain.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A means I wake up early. Option B is better.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B is the only fair one. Option C is a trap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,I vote for B. I don't want a box.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,I vote for B. I can't pay for C.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for B. It keeps us honest.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
