69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I vote for B. It is the only equal choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,Everyone agrees on B?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,Yes. It is the most balanced.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,We will need a strict schedule.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I will draft the rotation.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Ensure the narrow frontage is handled carefully.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Great. Let's do it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
